// str_to_int takes any receiver at compile time (unknown parameter, like ord,
// DEC-019) and rejects a non-string at RUNTIME with the VM's type_name —
// worded identically by the seed VM, the C backend, the zig VM and LLVM.
// EXPECT-RUNTIME-ERROR: str_to_int expects a string, got int
fn main() {
    print(str_to_int(42))
}
